<section class="refineryjobs"><div class="sect">REFINERY · YOUR JOBS AND GOODS</div><p class="dim small">Jobs keep running while you are away. Collect here when docked or within 500 units. Only you can collect your goods. Smaller amounts stay stored until they add up to a whole tonne.</p><%~ it.batchesMap %><%~ it.readyMap %><%~ it.dataOrdersMap %><div class="rrow"><span>Fuel Cells: <%~ it.refineryClientStateYou %>t · each adds <%~ it.refineryRulesFuelPerCell %> fuel, uses the cell</span><button class="btn sm" data-refinery="fuelQuote" <%~ it.refineryClientStateYou2 %>>USE 1 CELL → <%~ it.refineryRulesFuelPerCell2 %> FUEL</button></div><%~ it.refineryClientStateRefineryFuelQuote %></section>